      "uid": "zhcn:55bbc59835bc2112772cb4e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ええ。\nある縁で、繋がりまして――",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f143f264bf5ae66f42fd2ee7d2d70243a949324c310bcc6c04c78a091c94470",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
