    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:147878cdce19cc7ddac11f8a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ドリームジャーニーが先頭だッ！！\n前に出る！！　ドリームジャーニー！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a948978ca077536a0ed9eaf28766c18ce24f3dad550f57c4db18fe05930b79f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119311.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a8e43598b9783c33b28389d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ドリームジャーニーと自分は、\n次なる“旅”の目的地を確認する\nミーティングを行っていた。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e5ac0c4b9fae4ef08c4c04ae6267461ef527ba823e7177342f3e0120461641d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119311.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e289cfec9d8fca53022326e9",
      "kind": "story",
